<title>UK: BSkyB continues advance after ADR's climb.</title>
<headline>BSkyB continues advance after ADR's climb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Sky Broadcasting Group Plc benefited from follow-through buying on Tuesday after gains in their ADRs in New York, traders said.</p>
<p>The shares were up 17p at 628-1/2p by 1121 GMT.</p>
<p>&quot;They were strong on Wall Street overnight and it has just continued through this morning,&quot; said one senior trader.</p>
<p>The ADRs were up $2.38 at $60.5 in the U.S. on Monday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
